          "snippet": {
            "text": "theorem norm_Todd_le (α : ℝ) :\n    ‖Todd α x m‖ ≤ x / (2 * m) + eta2'L1 / 2 ∧\n    (Real.sin (2 * π * m * α) ≠ 0 →\n      ‖Todd α x m‖ ≤ eta2'L1 / 2 / |Real.sin (2 * π * m * α)| ∧\n      ‖Todd α x m‖ ≤ m / x * (c₀ / 2) / Real.sin (2 * π * m * α) ^ 2) := by",
