            ],
            "conclusion": "The three bounds assembled for `η = η₂` (odd-`m` sum `T_{m,∘}`): `|T| ≤ x/2m + |η'|₁/2`, `≤ (|η'|₁/2)/|sin 2πmα|`, `≤ (m/x)(c₀/2)/sin²(2πmα)`."
